.TH oct-output-versions 1  "oct-output-versions " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-output\-versions \- Show supported output format versions
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct output\-versions\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Show supported output format versions for JSON and YAML output.
.PP
Mark the currently chosen one with a star.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
